<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Hapoalim opens Berlin office.</title>
<headline>Israel's Hapoalim opens Berlin office.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Hapoalim, Israel's largest bank, said it had opened an office in Berlin, its second in Germany.</p>
<p>Hapoalim also has an office in Frankfurt.</p>
<p>The new office will enable Hapoalim to expand activity in Germany, especially in the development of business ventures between the two countries.</p>
<p>The bank operates in 16 countries.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
